    """Deterministic topological order, ties broken by lexicographically smallest ID.

    Kahn's algorithm over a heap-backed ready set: the result is a pure
    function of the deduplicated graph, independent of input order, so plan and
    rollback observe the same full order. A nonempty remainder means a cycle
    anywhere in the graph, including components unreachable from the roots.
